      "autoClaim:1": 0,
      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Every gate is lit: the starter haven, the AE door, seven voltage milestones from steam to luminescent, the crossover complex, the trials, the counters. Twelve anchors, one campaign — and one industrial baron standing in the wreckage of a job extremely done.\n\nYou ran steam empires through GTSR hubs, spread wireless webs over three bases with GTSWN, and made the cat economy hum with GTIT — three mods, one machine, all yours. The singularities kept the lights on; the coins kept the cats in business.\n\nThe graduation prize sits below. Beyond it, the GTIT trade shop's final page opens the moment this quest completes — critical singularities, reinforced chips, infinite cells and the dragon's own egg, priced in shimmer. The campaign is over; the economy is not. Congratulations, Master.",
